摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"FFmpeg toolkit with CLI, MCP server, and AI tool schemas","id":"gh:1205593265","install_available":false,"language":"Python","name":"ff-toolkit","slug":"inthepond/ff-toolkit","topics":["agent-tools","ai-agents","deepseek-harness","dsh-plugin","ffmpeg","llm-tools","mcp","tool-calling","video-processing"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"FFmpeg toolkit with CLI, MCP server, and AI tool schemas"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# ff-toolkit"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"FFmpeg operations as LLM-callable tools."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"> **Stop hand-writing FFmpeg subprocess calls and JSON tool schemas.**\n> `ff-toolkit` gives you 5 pr"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"oduction-ready media operations, dual-format LLM schemas (OpenAI + Anthropic), and an MCP server — a"},{"id":"p4s3","text":"ll in one `pip install`."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"## Real-World Use Cases"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"**\"My agent pipeline needs to process uploaded videos\"** — Give your agent `openai_tools()` or `anth"},{"id":"p6s2","text":"ropic_tools()` and let it decide how to clip, transcode, or extract audio. The `dispatch()` function"},{"id":"p6s3","text":"let it decide how to clip, transcode, or extract audio. The `dispatch()` function handles execution."},{"id":"p7s1","text":"**\"I need to batch-extract 16kHz WAV for ASR\"** — One line: `extract_audio(\"video.mp4\", \"out.wav\", c"},{"id":"p7s2","text":"odec=\"pcm_s16le\", sample_rate=16000, channels=1)`"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"**\"I want FFmpeg tools in Claude Desktop / Cursor\"** — Add the MCP server config (3 lines of JSON) a"},{"id":"p8s2","text":"nd Claude can edit your videos directly."},{"id":"p9s1","text":"**\"I want FFmpeg tools in DeepSeek Harness\"** — `dsh plugin add dsh-ffkit` installs the native plugi"},{"id":"p9s2","text":"n from integrations/deepseek-harness."},{"id":"p10s1","text":"**\"I'm tired of writing the same FFmpeg commands\"** — Use the CLI: `ffkit clip input.mp4 output.mp4 "},{"id":"p10s2","text":"--start 00:01:00 --duration 30`"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"## 60-Second Quick Start"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"### Python API"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"### CLI"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"### With OpenAI (3 lines to integrate)"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"### With Anthropic (3 lines to integrate)"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"### As an MCP Server (Claude Desktop / Cursor)"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"Add to your config (`claude_desktop_config.json` or Cursor settings):"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"That's it. Claude can now clip, merge, extract audio, add subtitles, and transcode your files."},{"id":"p25s1","text":"### As a DeepSeek Harness plugin"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"DeepSeek Harness (dsh) is DeepSeek's plugin-based agent runtime. ff-toolkit ships a native dsh plugi"},{"id":"p26s2","text":"n — the `dsh-ffkit` npm package in integrations/deepseek-harness:"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"The plugin registers all five operations as typed harness tools with structured canonical outputs (u"},{"id":"p28s2","text":"sable from dsh Code Mode) and UI cards. Under the hood each call runs `python -m ff_kit.bridge`, a o"},{"id":"p28s3","text":"ne-shot JSON entry point over stdin/stdout that any host runtime can reuse. See the plugin README fo"},{"id":"p28s4","text":"ry point over stdin/stdout that any host runtime can reuse. See the plugin README for configuration."},{"id":"p29s1","text":"## Operations"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"| Tool | What it does | Example |"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"| `ffkit_clip` | Trim a segment by start + end/duration | Cut highlight reel from raw footage |\n| `f"},{"id":"p31s2","text":"fkit_merge` | Concatenate multiple files | Join intro + content + outro |\n| `ffkit_extract_audio` | "},{"id":"p31s3","text":"Extract audio, optionally re-encode | Get 16kHz WAV for speech recognition |\n| `ffkit_add_subtitles`"},{"id":"p31s4","text":" | Burn or embed subtitles (.srt/.ass/.vtt) | Hard-sub a translated SRT into video |\n| `ffkit_transc"},{"id":"p31s5","text":"ode` | Convert format, codec, resolution, bitrate | Compress 4K MP4 to 720p WebM for web |"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"## How It Works"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"## Project Structure"},{"id":"p35s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p36s1","text":"## Development"},{"id":"p37s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p38s1","text":"## FAQ"},{"id":"p39s1","text":"**Q: Do I need FFmpeg installed?**\nYes, for actual media operations. Tests are fully mocked and don'"},{"id":"p39s2","text":"t need FFmpeg. Install it from ffmpeg.org/download or `brew install ffmpeg` / `apt install ffmpeg`."},{"id":"p40s1","text":"**Q: Can I add custom operations?**\nYes — add a function in `core/`, register it in `dispatch.py`'s "},{"id":"p40s2","text":"`_REGISTRY`, and add schema entries in `schemas/openai.py` and `schemas/anthropic.py`. See any exist"},{"id":"p40s3","text":"ing operation as a template."},{"id":"p41s1","text":"**Q: Why not just use LangChain / CrewAI tools?**\nThose frameworks are great, but they're heavy depe"},{"id":"p41s2","text":"ndencies. ff-toolkit is zero-dependency (beyond Python stdlib) and works with any LLM provider. You "},{"id":"p41s3","text":"can use it inside LangChain if you want, or standalone."},{"id":"p42s1","text":"**Q: What about streaming / progress callbacks?**\nNot in v0.1. FFmpeg progress parsing is planned fo"},{"id":"p42s2","text":"at about streaming / progress callbacks?**\nNot in v0.1. FFmpeg progress parsing is planned for v0.2."},{"id":"p43s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p44s1","text":"MIT"}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
